<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>phpgen - Configurar {{ table }}</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 900px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 1rem; background: #f9fafb; color: #111; }
        h1 { color: #1e40af; }
        a { color: #2563eb; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: white; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.1); }
        th, td { padding: .6rem .8rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: left; }
        th { background: #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600; }
        code { background: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: .9em; }
        .btn { background: #16a34a; color: white; padding: .7rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 6px; border: 0; cursor: pointer; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; }
        .btn:hover { background: #15803d; }
        .tag { display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: .75em; font-weight: 600; margin-left: 4px; }
        .tag-pk { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; }
        .tag-fk { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }
        .actions { margin-top: 2rem; padding: 1.5rem; background: white; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.1); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <p><a href="?action=home">&larr; Voltar</a></p>
    <h1>Configurar: <code>{{ table }}</code></h1>

    <h2>Colunas detectadas</h2>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Coluna</th>
                <th>Tipo</th>
                <th>Nulo</th>
                <th>Default</th>
                <th>Chave</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for c in schema %}
            <tr>
                <td>
                    {{ c.name }}
                    {% if c.key == 'PRI' %}<span class="tag tag-pk">PK</span>{% endif %}
                    {% for fk in fks %}{% if fk.column == c.name %}<span class="tag tag-fk">FK &rarr; {{ fk.ref_table }}.{{ fk.ref_column }}</span>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
                </td>
                <td><code>{{ c.raw_type }}</code></td>
                <td>{{ c.nullable ? 'Sim' : 'Nao' }}</td>
                <td>{{ c.default is not null ? c.default : '-' }}</td>
                <td>{{ c.key ?: '-' }}</td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="actions">
        <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Gerar codigo</h2>
        <p>Vai criar 3 arquivos em <code>generated/{{ table }}/</code>:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><code>Grid.php</code> &mdash; listagem com botoes de editar e excluir</li>
            <li><code>Form.php</code> &mdash; formulario de criacao e edicao</li>
            <li><code>Delete.php</code> &mdash; exclusao por chave primaria</li>
        </ul>
        <form method="post" action="?action=generate">
            <input type="hidden" name="table" value="{{ table }}">
            <button type="submit" class="btn">Gerar CRUD para esta tabela</button>
        </form>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
